  "scope": "Two real isolated Electron processes with malformed workspace and credential files exit with code 1 before the unchanged 30-second discovery deadline. Exact phase/resource diagnostics are captured and private input is omitted. The isolated diagnostic flag prevents an unattended native startup error dialog from blocking exit. Normal production startup errors keep their native dialog. This reproduces the native error reporting branch; it does not identify the earlier hosted startup timeout cause."
